/T (The current team of six refugees run the entire operation: registration, warehousing, voucher allocation, choice-based distribution, and reporting for a registered beneficiary base of approximately 27,200, distributing 52,290 items in 2025 alone. An operation of this size would not ordinarily be expected of a team this small.)
/E (The current team of six refugees run the entire operation: registration, warehousing, voucher allocation, choice-based distribution, and reporting for a registered beneficiary base of approximately 27,200, distributing 52,290 items in 2025 alone. An operation of this size would not ordinarily be expected of a team this small.)
