1681 0 obj
<<
/Title (Operational learning from The Free Shop Lebanon showed that utilising Boxtribute digital systems and recommended workflows created highly effective and efficient operational capacity for TFS. TFS could easily integrate its processes and operations, including defining eligibility criteria, allocation mechanisms, and structured intake workflows, based on Boxtribute's suggestions. This accelerated distributions while strengthening fairness, protection, and consistency.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 830 0 R
/Next 2206 0 R
>>
endobj
