>>
endobj
1683 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Free Shop was established by an international project lead with the intention of handing it over to local leadership; Boxtribute made that possible. Eligibility criteria, allocation logic, appointment scheduling, and vulnerability tagging were all held in the system rather than informally, so when four local staff took over daily operations after a six-week setup, they inherited the protection standards along with the workflows.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 831 0 R
>>
endobj
1684 0 obj
<<
/Title (Capacity Without Headcount)
